  "goodToKnow": "Der Anwohner (die Anwohnerin) is a resident of a particular street or area: die Anwohner der Hauptstraße. You'll see it on traffic signs: Anlieger frei or Anwohner frei (access for residents only), and Anwohnerparken means residents' parking, which requires an Anwohnerparkausweis. In news, Anwohner often protest against noise, building sites or new wind farms. Plural: die Anwohner."
